	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Epistolam proxime 8. ianuarii ad me datam tertia februarii <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>accepi.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Negligentię te minime, sed potius me ipsum arguo, qui <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nunc functionibus omnibus defunctus esse videor.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quantum <lb xml:id="p1z4"/><persName>Ionam</persName> meum ratione chelis attinet, dicit ipse disertis verbis se <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>nulli pro ea debere quicquam, sed dominum <persName>Simblerum</persName> pro eo instrumento <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>sibi adscripsisse coronatum <placeName ref="l832">Gallicum</placeName>, id quod etiam ratiuncula <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>transmissa continet.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Velim igitur boni viri querelas esse sedatas.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>De solutione debitorum nuper scripsi et promissa deo auspice brevi <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>praestabo.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><persName>Ionas</persName> ulcerum et scabieie plęnus est adeo, ut non dum mem<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>bra, sed ne ingenium quidem offitium suum faciat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Translationis munus librorum tuorum De gratia quam lubentissime subirem; <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>nihil profecto fuerit mihi iucundius quam in agro tuo, imo dei optimi <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>agriculturam exercere.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Sed cum non unum, verum centum onera <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>feram, nunc brevi opus tuum aggredi vix fieri potest.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Fęcit <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>mihi negotium ingens magister <persName ref="p8130">Laurentius Agricola Vituduranus</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>cuius rerum bellicarum stratagemata<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Vgl. in auch Brief 26101 (<persName ref="p8130">Agricola/Meyer</persName> an Ottheinrich, 15. Mai 1556: "die dry gwaltigen buͤcher der kriegskampffstucken"); Ludwig <hi>Rockinger,</hi> Die Pflege der Geschichte durch die Wittelsbacher. Akademische FS zur Feier des Wittelsbacher Jubiläums, München [1880], Beilage I, S. (15): "Laurentij Agricolae tomus tertius rerum bellicarum, ex clarissimis romanae historiae historiographis. vngepunden[sic] vnd geschriben." (In der Liste von Büchern, die Ottheinrich 1556 von Neuburg nach Heidelberg mitbrachte.).</note> princeps Ottohenrichus <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>vertendi pondus mihi imposuit.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Vocat me idem princeps iam <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ad archigrammateatus sui functionem, idem facit magistratus <lb xml:id="p1z20"/><placeName ref="l18">Augustanus</placeName> cum egregiis pollicitationibus.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Miraberis, si aliquando <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Proteotica hęc ex me recte et per longum intellexeris.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Quippe hę <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>vocationes per integros menses duos mihi dubium iniiecerunt, utrius<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>nam voluntati obtemperarem; vicit tandem principis <persName>Ottonis</persName> clęmentia <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>et pietas, quę mihi exulanti et ex <placeName ref="l18">Augusta</placeName> pulso manum <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>largam satis porrexit.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Illi meas operas promisi, nondum tamen <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>omnino constitui cancellariatum suscipere.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l18">Augustani</placeName> videntur <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>sentiscere morbigenus aliquod, quo laborant, cui mederi meum <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>non erit.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Dominus autem det illis resipiscendi animum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Res <placeName ref="l830">Anglice</placeName> plęrosque perturbant, plęrosque etiam exhilarant.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Cardinalis <lb xml:id="p1z30"/><placeName ref="l18">Augustanus</placeName> habuit nuper contionem congratulatoriam super restitutione <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>regni Anglici ad Romanam ecclesiam largitusque est multas miriades <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>indulgentiarum omnibus, qui pro constantia reginę orent et principi <placeName ref="l875">His<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>paniarum</placeName> felicia precentur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Cęsar, ut rumor est, transfretabit propediem in <placeName ref="l875">Hispanias</placeName> nunquam <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>rediturus.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Quos Germanie relicturus sit aculeos tempus declarabit; <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>certo certius est malum iam iterum atque iterum monstrum ali a nonnullis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/>Ad 5. februarii filia mea Affra celebratura est nuptias <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>cum eleganti iuvene, pro quibus coniugatis et pro ipsorum <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>salute deum optimum maximum mecum intense precaberis.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale cum <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>tota domo tua.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">3. februarii ex <placeName ref="l279">Lauginga</placeName> 1554.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z41"/>Tuus <persName ref="p8354">Georgius Lętus</persName> a <placeName>Lömnitz</placeName> etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/>Ich hab gar ein liben frund <persName>Jacob Relinger</persName> zuͦ <placeName>Ledder</placeName>, weiland <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>herr <persName ref="p6185">Ulrich Rehlinger</persName>, burgermaisters zu <placeName ref="l18">A[ugspurg</placeName>] sone, den ich fur einen christen <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>ere unnd halt.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de">Der hett gern einen kirchendiner eur confessione.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z45"/>Bitte euch freuntlich, ir wollend ime einen zuschicken und daneben <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>schriben, das er uff min fuͦrdrung dahin komme; er wurdt guͦten platz <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>haben.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="de">Die zittung in <placeName ref="l830">Engelland</placeName> wollen sich enndern.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z48"/><persName>Hertzog Hans Friederich</persName> und <persName ref="p18509">hertzog August von <lb xml:id="p1z49"/>Saxen</persName> sollen entlich vertragen sin.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Incomparabili viro domino <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p495">Henricho Bullingero</persName>, ecclesias<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>tę <placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName> vigilantissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>amico ut fratri<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
